<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 8/9.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 8/9.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Tuesday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for Wednesday, July 9. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   09.07.97	  08.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.7380	    6.7604</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2810	    2.2932</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.4890	    4.5150</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5414	    3.5670</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5153	    0.5196</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7663	    0.7704</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2851	    0.2867</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0182	    7.0342</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6909	    0.6910</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2130	    1.2173</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
